note for test at the latch on a signed counter that the body makes negative (B.LT, not B.LO): the first pass
note sets i to -5, so i = 0, -4 .. 2 runs 8 passes (exit 8); an unsigned latch test leaves after 1 pass
om2
fn main to int
n = long 0
for i long 3
if eq n 0
i = sub i 5
end
n = add n 1
end
ret int n
end
